@base = http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 1. POST request to create a room (expect 201 + Location: /api/rooms/1)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Room A", "capacity": 10 }

### 2. POST request to create room 2 (expect 201 + Location: /api/rooms/2)
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Room B", "capacity": 15 }

### 3. GET request to list all rooms (expect 200, 2 rooms)
GET {{base}}

### 4. GET request to list room 1 (expect 200)
GET {{base}}/1

### 5. PUT request to update room 1 (expect 200)
PUT {{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name":  "Room A updated", "capacity": 11}

### 6. DELETE request to delete room 1 (expect 204)
DELETE {{base}}/1

### 7. GET request for the now deleted room 1 (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/1

### 8. GET request for a room that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/99

### 9. PUT request for a room that doesn't exist (expect 404)
PUT {{base}}/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Non-existent room", "capacity": 5 }

### 10. DELETE request for room 1 again (expect 404)
DELETE {{base}}/1